{
  "summary": "A baseline multimodal configuration was tested, combining RNA data encoded with pca_n2000 and image data encoded with resnet50 via concatenation without aggregation. The validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 score of 0.5104 suggest the multimodal approach achieves moderate performance, but no direct comparison to unimodal baselines is available. The effectiveness of the concatenation fusion strategy and the impact of encoder choices remain uncertain without additional comparative experiments."
}

